{"type":"app","meta":{"headers":{"x-nextjs-stale-time":"300","x-nextjs-prerender":"1","x-next-cache-tags":"_N_T_/layout,_N_T_/learn/layout,_N_T_/learn/[slug]/layout,_N_T_/learn/[slug]/page,_N_T_/learn/druckenmiller-admit-wrong-fast"}},"html":"<!DOCTYPE html><!--2DJ2zhzL_dHSrK5QsdDKA--><html lang=\"zh-TW\" data-density=\"comfortable\" data-font-size=\"standard\" class=\"__variable_07e1b6 __variable_cc7473 h-full antialiased\"><head><meta charSet=\"utf-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/3d26d2f3aa81a833-s.p.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/604a121a6fa1a135-s.p.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/6e1768769e6f59a2-s.p.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/ab2e3a11646b0499-s.p.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/75c047ba52e43fcc.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/aa90c9a426448e43.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/e55779c04dd245e2.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/8c57d5c3b938342e.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/3eaf36e367672966.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"script\" fetchPriority=\"low\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-1cf2182201f6bdb6.js\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/4bd1b696-100b9d70ed4e49c1.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/1255-ab54a41c275880be.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/main-app-acf4587a940f1946.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/2619-04bc32f026a0d946.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/app/layout-4382c12d510386d3.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/app/learn/%5Bslug%5D/page-f7b99344f7e2ee16.js\" async=\"\"></script><meta name=\"next-size-adjust\" content=\"\"/><title>德魯肯米勒為什麼認錯要快？3個代價比方向更貴｜股市大佬 TradeBoss</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"史坦利·德魯肯米勒在公開場合被問到教訓時，常回到同一句：錯了就要快承認。不是因為認錯比較道德，是因為留著錯的部位，會讓後面的判斷全部變形——你開始為了回本而看市場，不再為了現在的事實看市場。方向錯一次是成本；為了面子留著，是讓成本生利息。\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico\" type=\"image/x-icon\" sizes=\"16x16\"/><script>(function(){try{var t=localStorage.getItem('obsidian-theme');if(t!=='light'&&t!=='dark')t='dark';document.documentElement.setAttribute('data-theme',t);document.documentElement.style.colorScheme=(t==='light'?'light':'dark');}catch(e){document.documentElement.setAttribute('data-theme','dark');}})();(function(){try{if(localStorage.getItem('obsidian-comfort-read')==='1')document.documentElement.classList.add('comfort-read');}catch(e){}})();(function(){try{var s=localStorage.getItem('obsidian-updown');if(s==='us')document.documentElement.setAttribute('data-updown','us');}catch(e){}})();(function(){try{var prefs=JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('bs-preferences-v1')||'{}');var root=document.documentElement;prefs=prefs&&typeof prefs==='object'?prefs:{};root.setAttribute('data-font-size',['standard','large','xlarge','huge'].indexOf(prefs.fontSize)>=0?prefs.fontSize:'standard');root.setAttribute('data-density',prefs.density==='compact'?'compact':'comfortable');}catch(e){}})();</script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-42372ed130431b0a.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"min-h-screen bg-background text-foreground selection:bg-cyan/30 review-mode pb-40 lg:pb-16\" data-review-theme=\"dark\"><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><a href=\"#main-content\" class=\"skip-link fixed left-3 top-3 z-[80] -translate-y-24 rounded-xl bg-accent px-4 py-2 font-black text-bg shadow-lg transition focus:translate-y-0\">跳到主要內容</a><main id=\"main-content\" class=\"w-full\"><div class=\"LearnArticle_wrap__LIQ8G\"><article class=\"LearnArticle_article__2nBbk\"><p class=\"LearnArticle_meta__etj_G\"><a class=\"LearnArticle_cat__GQMlg\" href=\"/learn?c=stories\">人物與市場史</a><span class=\"LearnArticle_read__QEj6a\">閱讀約 3 分鐘</span></p><h1 class=\"LearnArticle_title__0_la8\">德魯肯米勒為什麼認錯要快？3個代價比方向更貴</h1><details class=\"LearnArticle_toc__LcSAa\"><summary class=\"LearnArticle_tocSummary__YBddG\">本文目錄</summary><ol class=\"LearnArticle_tocList__Rq_Lz\"><li><a href=\"#sec-1\">一、公開訪談在強調哪一種錯</a></li><li><a href=\"#sec-2\">二、三個比方向更貴的代價</a></li><li><a href=\"#sec-3\">三、快，靠的是事前句子</a></li><li><a href=\"#sec-4\">四、和損失趨避是同一件事</a></li><li><a href=\"#sec-5\">五、最小動作</a></li><li><a href=\"#sec-6\">常見問題 FAQ</a></li><li><a href=\"#sec-7\">總結</a></li><li><a href=\"#sec-8\">延伸閱讀</a></li></ol></details><div class=\"LearnArticle_body__6B7Mb\"><p class=\"LearnArticle_intro__ATV5c\">史坦利·德魯肯米勒在公開場合被問到教訓時，常回到同一句：錯了就要快承認。不是因為認錯比較道德，是因為留著錯的部位，會讓後面的判斷全部變形——你開始為了回本而看市場，不再為了現在的事實看市場。方向錯一次是成本；為了面子留著，是讓成本生利息。</p><div class=\"LearnArticle_tldr__Br5BY\"><b class=\"LearnArticle_tldrTitle__K5PBN\">本文重點</b><ul class=\"LearnArticle_tldrList__VSc2_\"><li>看錯是成本，留著錯是讓成本生利息</li><li>回本目標會把下一筆也綁在舊錯誤上</li><li>快認錯需要事先寫好的離開條件，不能靠當下勇氣</li></ul></div><section id=\"sec-1\" class=\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\"><h2 class=\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\">一、公開訪談在強調哪一種錯</h2><p class=\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\">他區分過「看法錯了」與「知道錯了還加碼或死守」。前者幾乎人人會遇到；後者才是帳戶常見的致命傷。傳播喜歡討論他看對過什麼，教材該停在他怎麼講看錯。</p><ul class=\"LearnArticle_listCheck__xx1CF\"><li>看法錯是日常</li><li>死守是選擇</li><li>選擇比較貴</li></ul></section><section id=\"sec-2\" class=\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\"><h2 class=\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\">二、三個比方向更貴的代價</h2><p class=\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\">第一，注意力被舊單佔走，新的事實看不進去。第二，為了回到成本，部位往往愈留愈大。第三，規則被當下心情改寫，後面的樣本不能用。三個代價疊在一起，檢討會變成「我方向其實對，只是時間不對」。</p><div class=\"LearnArticle_tblScroll__z9kbb\"><table class=\"LearnArticle_tbl__0yNgv\"><thead><tr><th>代價</th><th>當下感覺</th><th>帳戶實際在付</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>注意力被佔</td><td>我在負責</td><td>看不到新事實</td></tr><tr><td>為回本加碼</td><td>成本下降</td><td>同一筆錯誤變大</td></tr><tr><td>改規則</td><td>這次特殊</td><td>樣本作廢</td></tr><tr><td>說時間不對</td><td>還有希望</td><td>失效條件被刪</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section id=\"sec-3\" class=\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\"><h2 class=\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\">三、快，靠的是事前句子</h2><p class=\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\">當下認錯很痛，痛的時候人會找理由。所以快必須被寫成進場前的句子：怎樣算錯、誰有權叫我走。智慧單與失效條件兩篇，是這句話的工具版。人物故事只負責提醒：連被外界寫成很準的人，公開時仍把速度放在準度前面。</p><ol class=\"LearnArticle_listNum__86N5S\"><li>進場前寫作廢</li><li>作廢就走</li><li>走了才准解釋</li></ol><figure class=\"LearnArticle_fig__uoT7r\"><div class=\"LearnArticle_figFrame__jJ7E4\">✓怎樣算錯✓誰叫我走✓走了再解釋</div><figcaption class=\"LearnArticle_figCap__LnUbb\">事前寫好</figcaption></figure></section><section id=\"sec-4\" class=\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\"><h2 class=\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\">四、和損失趨避是同一件事</h2><p class=\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\">損失趨避讓人不肯做實虧損。認錯要快，就是在跟這個人性作對。作對不能靠喊話，要靠小到你做得動的上限。上限太大，快只是口號。</p><ul class=\"LearnArticle_listCheck__xx1CF\"><li>痛是預設</li><li>上限要小到做得動</li><li>口號改不了痛</li></ul></section><section id=\"sec-5\" class=\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\"><h2 class=\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\">五、最小動作</h2><p class=\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\">翻最近一筆拖最久的虧，寫下你當時新找的理由。若理由不在進場前那張紙上，那就是這篇要擋的東西。</p></section><section id=\"sec-6\" class=\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\"><h2 class=\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\">常見問題 FAQ</h2><div class=\"LearnArticle_faq__cemBp\"><details class=\"LearnArticle_faqItem__I9h0U\"><summary>快認錯是不是賺不到大行情？</summary><p class=\"LearnArticle_faqA__IPuvc\">大行情若理由還在，離開條件就還沒到。快的是理由沒了要走，不是漲了就要走。</p></details><details class=\"LearnArticle_faqItem__I9h0U\"><summary>跟停損是不是同一句？</summary><p class=\"LearnArticle_faqA__IPuvc\">停損是工具。認錯是決定用工具。沒寫在進場前，工具會在痛的時候被關。</p></details><details class=\"LearnArticle_faqItem__I9h0U\"><summary>看對開頭後來錯了怎麼辦？</summary><p class=\"LearnArticle_faqA__IPuvc\">開頭對過，不表示現在還對。以現在的條件重問，不要用舊高峰保護舊單。</p></details><details class=\"LearnArticle_faqItem__I9h0U\"><summary>為什麼常被拿來跟索羅斯一起講？</summary><p class=\"LearnArticle_faqA__IPuvc\">公開經歷有重疊。本篇只取「認錯要快」這一句能檢查的結構。</p></details></div></section><section id=\"sec-7\" class=\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\"><h2 class=\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\">總結</h2><p class=\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\">看錯是成本，留著錯會讓成本生利息。三個代價：注意力、加碼、改規則。快認錯要靠進場前的作廢句，不靠勇氣。</p></section><section id=\"sec-8\" class=\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\"><h2 class=\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\">延伸閱讀</h2><ul class=\"LearnArticle_list__WjxqC\"><li><a class=\"LearnArticle_link__gMwHV\" href=\"/learn/loss-aversion-in-trading\">損失趨避</a></li><li><a class=\"LearnArticle_link__gMwHV\" href=\"/learn/write-invalidation-before-you-enter\">失效條件</a></li><li><a class=\"LearnArticle_link__gMwHV\" href=\"/learn/tudor-jones-risk-first-interviews\">都鐸瓊斯怎麼看風險</a></li></ul></section><div class=\"LearnArticle_related__9qV55\"><p class=\"LearnArticle_relatedTitle__RXfrl\">相關文章</p><a class=\"LearnArticle_relatedLink__mibXe\" href=\"/learn/loss-aversion-in-trading\">損失趨避</a><a class=\"LearnArticle_relatedLink__mibXe\" href=\"/learn/write-invalidation-before-you-enter\">失效條件</a><a class=\"LearnArticle_relatedLink__mibXe\" href=\"/learn/tudor-jones-risk-first-interviews\">都鐸瓊斯怎麼看風險</a></div></div></article></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-1cf2182201f6bdb6.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[81259,[\\\"2619\\\",\\\"static/chunks/2619-04bc32f026a0d946.js\\\",\\\"7177\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/layout-4382c12d510386d3.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n3:I[89379,[\\\"2619\\\",\\\"static/chunks/2619-04bc32f026a0d946.js\\\",\\\"7177\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/layout-4382c12d510386d3.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n4:I[9766,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n5:I[98924,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n6:I[10021,[\\\"2619\\\",\\\"static/chunks/2619-04bc32f026a0d946.js\\\",\\\"7177\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/layout-4382c12d510386d3.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n7:I[10528,[\\\"2619\\\",\\\"static